        "text": "#### **[10] Nvidia Pledges $250M in Compute for UK AI Safety Research**\n* **What is confirmed:** Nvidia announced a 5-year commitment valued at $250 million ($50M annually) in accelerated computing resources to support UK AI safety research, focusing on agentic AI security, robotics, and foundation model safety"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1287,
        "endIndex": 1378,
        "text": "Key recipients include Oxford’s BOLD lab, UCL’s SOFAIR lab, and Imperial College London"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1380,
        "endIndex": 1445,
        "text": "Compute will be hosted locally via UK-based Nvidia Cloud Partners"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        1
      ]
    },
