        "endIndex": 2049,
        "text": "#### **[13] SpaceX Restricts Starlink Speeds in Ukraine, Disrupting Drones**\n* **What is confirmed:** Ukrainian presidential adviser Serhii \"Flash\" Beskrestnov and frontline military units confirmed SpaceX implemented an unannounced 100 mph (160 km/h) speed restriction on Starshield (military-grade Starlink) terminals operating in motion"
