        "endIndex": 2152,
        "text": "The cap has caused connectivity drops and disrupted active drone and air-defense interceptor missions"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        2,
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2154,
        "endIndex": 2299,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** SpaceX and CEO Elon Musk have not issued an official public statement or technical explanation regarding the speed limit"
