      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2436,
        "endIndex": 2852,
        "text": "#### **[7] OpenAI Engineer Arrested for Bugging Executive Conference Room**\n* **What is confirmed:** Federal prosecutors and the FBI unsealed charges against 35-year-old OpenAI engineer Abdulrahman Alfozan (a Saudi national) for secretly installing an encrypted audio recording device wrapped in toilet paper and plugged into a TV's USB port inside an executive conference room at OpenAI's San Francisco headquarters"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        6,
        7,
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2854,
        "endIndex": 3024,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** OpenAI and federal investigators confirmed there is no evidence that model weights, source code, or customer data were compromised or exfiltrated"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        9,
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3063,
        "endIndex": 3168,
        "text": "** High-impact story regarding insider threats, corporate espionage, and security within frontier AI labs"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
