    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3176,
        "endIndex": 3422,
        "text": "#### **[5] Anthropic Replaces Git with In-House \"Scion\" Version Control**\n* **What is confirmed:** Anthropic published an engineering post revealing it migrated its main monorepo from Git to a custom internal version control system called \"Scion\""
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        11,
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3424,
        "endIndex": 3621,
        "text": "The move was driven by daily code merges surging from ~2,500 in May to over 30,000 per day in September 2026, largely due to autonomous Claude coding agents overwhelming standard Git infrastructure"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        11,
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3623,
        "endIndex": 3846,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Scion was designed specifically for Anthropic’s centralized, online monorepo architecture and agent workflows; Anthropic confirmed it has no plans to open-source Scion as a general Git replacement"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        12,
        13
