        "endIndex": 4902,
        "text": "#### **[11] CoreWeave Pursues Insurance Capital for GPU Infrastructure Debt**\n* **What is confirmed:** CoreWeave co-founder Brannin McBee told the *Financial Times* that the AI cloud provider is working to secure investment-grade credit ratings on its chip-collateralized loans to tap long-term capital from global insurance funds"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
