      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 5378,
        "endIndex": 5589,
        "text": "#### **[6] Drone Strikes on Yandex Data Centers Disrupt Web Crawlers, Not Bot Farms**\n* **What is confirmed:** Ukrainian drone strikes hit three Yandex data center facilities in Russia (Sasovo, Kaluga, Vladimir)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
